{
  "version": 3,
  "doc": "An event built for a request whose raw query string (leading '?' included, or empty) is `query` must carry `q` exactly; no string in `absent` may appear in the serialized event. Same scrub_query as the Referer: each case mirrors the referer.json case with the same id. Contract: .agent-team/runs/2026-10-12-bugfix/contracts/sdk-conformance.md (C6).",
